# The forty-seven tasks of the P1 protocol's FIFTH round, fixed before the round's first cell.
#
# Each line is the SHA-256 of a deterministic tar of one task directory, made from the directory
# that holds the tasks with:
#   tar --sort=name --format=gnu --mtime="UTC 1970-01-01" --owner=0 --group=0 --numeric-owner \
#       --exclude=__pycache__ --exclude="*.pyc" -cf - <id> | sha256sum
# The tasks themselves are held out and not published; this file is what lets a reader check
# that none of them changed between this commit and the result.
